WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.960
A ship in a storm.

2
00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:06.440
Thunder roars, and the sailors
shout that the ship is splitting.

3
00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:10.050
Later, a feast appears
before the shipwrecked lords.

4
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.090
Then it vanishes.

5
00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:14.870
A winged figure drops
from above and cries,

6
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:18.430
"You are three men of sin," Above it all,

7
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.440
a robed figure watches every moment.

8
00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:23.840
So what is all this magic for?

9
00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:27.410
In this mission, you'll see
where Prospero's art comes from,

10
00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:32.300
and why a law of 1604 made
conjuring spirits so dangerous.

11
00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:35.680
You'll stand beneath the harpy
as she accuses the lords.

12
00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:40.250
And you'll go backstage, to see
how each spell might be staged,

13
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:43.770
right up to "Our revels now are ended."

14
00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:47.480
Your mission: work out what
Prospero's magic is for.
